{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Product-Specific & Compliance FAQ Section (v3.1)
  Transparent return policy, shipping details, and explicit cosmetic safety guidelines
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-faq-section" id="faq" style="padding: 72px 0;">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Everything You Need To Know</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Clear answers about our botanical sourcing, daily usage instructions, shipping timelines, and 30-day return policy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1: Sourcing & Function -->
      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" open style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>How does this botanical formula support scalp and strand comfort?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
          Our formulas harness pure unrefined plant lipids (such as Honduran Batana oil and Moroccan Argan) rich in oleic fatty acids and phytosterols. They condition the natural scalp moisture barrier, lubricate brittle hair cuticles, and reduce friction during styling—leading to visibly softer, more resilient strands without synthetic coating agents.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 2: Safety & Microneedling Compliance -->
      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>Can I use this product immediately after microneedling or on irritated skin?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>No.</strong> Zavelyn botanical oils, balms, and styling powders are formulated strictly for cosmetic conditioning on healthy, intact skin and hair. Do not apply directly to broken skin, open wounds, active infections, or immediately following at-home or clinical microneedling procedures until the epidermal barrier has fully healed and recovered.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 3: Product-specific Q -->
      {% if product.handle contains 'fibers' %}
        <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span>How do Keratin Building Fibers stay in place throughout the day?</span>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
          </summary>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
            Our fibers carry a natural electrostatic charge that creates an instant magnetic bond with existing hair shafts. They resist wind, humidity, and light workout perspiration, and wash out cleanly with your regular shampoo.
          </div>
        </details>
      {% elsif product.handle contains 'compact' %}
        <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span>How do I achieve a natural hairline touch-up without harsh lines?</span>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
          </summary>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
            Dab the high-density applicator sponge gently into the powder and tap off any excess. Start slightly behind your natural hairline and blend forward using light stippling motions for a seamless, soft-focus finish.
          </div>
        </details>
      {% elsif product.handle contains 'powder' %}
        <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span>Does this root-lift styling powder leave a white residue?</span>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
          </summary>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
            No. The micronized silica silylate formula turns completely invisible upon scalp contact and light fingertip distribution, delivering instant matte grip and volume without dulling hair color.
          </div>
        </details>
      {% else %}
        <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
          <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
            <span>Will this oil weigh down fine or straight hair textures?</span>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
          </summary>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
            When used as directed, no. For fine or low-porosity hair, use 2 to 3 drops as a pre-shampoo treatment 30 minutes before washing, or apply sparingly exclusively to fragile ends.
          </div>
        </details>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- FAQ 4: Shipping & Dispatch -->
      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>How fast does shipping take within the United States?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
          Orders are processed and dispatched within 24 to 48 business hours from our US distribution centers. Standard domestic shipping arrives in 2 to 5 business days with full door-to-door USPS / carrier tracking provided via email.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- FAQ 5: 30-Day Guarantee & Returns -->
      <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <span>What is your 30-Day Satisfaction Guarantee?</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
        </summary>
        <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
          We stand firmly behind the cosmetic quality of our botanical hair care. If you are not satisfied with your strand comfort or hair experience within 30 days of receiving your package, simply email us at <strong>support@tryzavelyn.com</strong> with your order confirmation number, and our team will guide you through our return and refund process.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC PDP FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
